{"id":"d90ddd4e02e45f78","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-model-diagram.md","title":"Complete Atomic Diagram","display":"df-zfc-model-diagram — Complete Atomic Diagram","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-diagram","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-diagram"],"display":"df-zfc-model-diagram — Complete Atomic Diagram","depends_on":["[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-diagram"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-diagram</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-diagram — Complete Atomic Diagram"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"58-df-language-with-constants.md\">58-df-language-with-constants.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\mathfrak A,L\\in V\">\\(D,\\mathfrak A,L\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"58-df-language-with-constants.md\">58-df-language-with-constants.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\n\\land\\exists L_{\\mathfrak A},c,\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\\mathfrak A,L_{\\mathfrak A},L,\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A),c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,L_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land D=\n\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A}):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\neg\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A})\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\n\\land\\exists L_{\\mathfrak A},c,\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\\mathfrak A,L_{\\mathfrak A},L,\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A),c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,L_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land D=\n\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A}):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\neg\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A})\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the complete atomic diagram in the expanded language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(L_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span>, not a set of old-language formulas with informal constants spliced into them.</li>\n<li>The named expansion fixes each new constant's interpretation, and truth is evaluated by one explicit satisfaction relation.</li>\n<li>Atomic sentences and the negations of the false atomic sentences are both included.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language-with-constants.md","status":"resolved","id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-language-with-constants.md","status":"resolved","id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S$ is from [[58-df-language-with-constants.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\mathfrak A,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelDiagram}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\n\\land\\exists L_{\\mathfrak A},c,\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\n\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,\\mathfrak A,L_{\\mathfrak A},L,\n\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A),c)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\n(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,L_{\\mathfrak A},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&{}\\land D=\n\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A}):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}{}\\cup\n\\Bigl\\{\\neg\\varphi:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L_{\\mathfrak A})\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{L_{\\mathfrak A}}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}{}\\land\n\\forall s\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A^\\ast,s)\n\\to\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L_{\\mathfrak A}","display":false}],"bytes":2231,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2702","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-model-diagram.md|58-df-zfc-model-diagram]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["303ea9f3c70914f9","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","8b6a90316aad78a4","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}